PalmPesa v2 payment integration

The payment endpoint is:
https://palmpesa.drmlelwa.co.tz/api/v2/palmpesa/payments

Production configuration can be supplied through these environment variables:
- PALMPESA_API_TOKEN
- PALMPESA_CALLBACK_URL
- PALMPESA_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET

The testing callback URL is:
https://tyisha-innovatory-ossie.ngrok-free.dev/ictsat/callback.php

SSL peer and hostname verification are disabled in process_payment.php for
testing only. Re-enable both checks before production deployment.

Set PALMPESA_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET in production to verify PalmPesa callback
signatures. When it is unset, unsigned callbacks are accepted for testing only.
